    "apiNote": {"x": 3660, "y": 1840, "w": 420, "text": "Built only on Web API endpoints new apps can still use: playback, devices, queue, library, playlists, albums, artists (top tracks + albums), search. No recommendations, related artists, audio features or Spotify-made playlists (restricted since Nov 2024).\n\nPlayback control needs Premium. Artwork is cached as small JPEGs; lists load 50 rows at a time to respect 2 GB of RAM."},
    "deckNote": {"x": 3440, "y": 0, "w": 420, "text": "Deck: the reels turn while playing and the right reel fills as the song progresses. Piano keys latch (PLAY or PAUSE stays down). Turn the knob for volume. The time is a mechanical counter. ⏏ ejects to the library browser. Up Next and AirPlay sit in the bottom bar like iTunes 10."}
